    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17767" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-κρᾰτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
